          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Exceptional Service!</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
          The team went above and beyond to help me. Their customer support is outstanding and they resolved my issue
          within minutes. Highly recommend!
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm">
          <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Sarah Johnson</span>
          <span class="text-gray-500">2 days ago</span>
